(8 parameters); \code{"sphere"} fits \eqn{\mathbf{o}}{o} only (\eqn{\mathbf{R} = \mathbf{A} =
\mathbf{I}}{R = A =
I}). The product of the radii is 1, so the sensor scale is kept.

