unit acceleration \eqn{\hat{\mathbf{a}}_i}{a_i} (gravity on static samples),
\deqn{\sin I_i = -\frac{\mathbf{M}_i \cdot \hat{\mathbf{a}}_i}{\|\mathbf{M}_i\|},}{sin(I_i) =
